        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkness rises. The train must move on.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Voxel Tycoon's Railroad to Hell 3</strong> — a hardcore old-school shooter born from the depths of voxel nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your cursed train on its last ride through a haunted wasteland — once alive, now swarming with monsters hungry for your soul. You’ve got 3 weapons, 50 waves, and one last ticket<strong>…</strong> straight to Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Voxel Tycoon comes a terrifying spin-off packed with bullets, chaos, and retro madness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> unique weapons — each deadlier than the last  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3</strong> upgrade tiers per weapon  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6</strong> stats to boost your survival chances  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50</strong> waves of monsters that won’t stop coming  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own strategy — or die trying  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully destructible voxel world  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish retro visuals and a furious Halloween soundtrack  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One goal only: <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>By buying this game, you help fuel the continued development of Voxel Tycoon — a strategy game about transportation, factory building, and mining in infinite voxel landscapes. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks for keeping the train rolling… even through Hell. 🎃</strong></p>",
